  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-13",
   "poolKey": "NO-MARKET",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "Goods change hands here between households, and nothing is set out for buying and selling in quantity.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-17",
   "poolKey": "BARE",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "What has to be done here is done by whoever does it alongside their own work.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-STR-1",
   "poolKey": "BEAST & RAIDER THREAT",
   "vid": 5,
   "spine": "The stock is brought in close and the households with it, and the outer ground is abandoned ground.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-CND-1",
   "poolKey": "SEVERITY: critical",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "This is as far as Warmholz bends, and almost none of the bend is left.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-CND-1",
   "poolKey": "DIRECTION: worsening",
   "vid": 1,
   "spine": "The slide here is steady rather than sudden, and each season costs a little more than the one before it.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "prosperity: Struggling / Poor",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "A year here ends near enough to level that the ending is watched.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "safetyProfile.safetyLabel: head word in {Dangerous, Desperate}",
   "vid": 3,
   "spine": "More happens here than is ever spoken of, and what is spoken of is not the worst of it.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "economicViability.viable: true",
   "vid": 4,
   "spine": "The hamlet covers what it costs on the terms it has, and the terms are not of its choosing.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "defenseProfile.readiness.label: Vulnerable",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "Less stands between these houses and trouble than stands around most places this size.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "scores.military: CRITICAL",
   "vid": 3,
   "spine": "Nobody here is under arms, and nothing is set up to change that.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "scores.monster: CRITICAL",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "Whatever lives past the last field is nobody's charge, and nothing is kept ready against it.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "scores.internal: WEAK",
   "vid": 1,
   "spine": "Plenty goes on that nobody answers for, and little of it is hidden from anybody passing through.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "scores.economic: WEAK",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "Nothing is spare, and that is the first thing a careful eye finds.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "scores.magical: CRITICAL",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "Magic is nobody's trade here, and nobody looks for it to be.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-3",
   "poolKey": "foodSecurity.label: Secure",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "Food is not something anybody here thinks about.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-6",
   "poolKey": "road",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "The road runs through the place rather than to it.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-6",
   "poolKey": "tier overlay: thorp / hamlet",
   "vid": 2,
   "spine": "Warmholz is a handful of roofs and the ground under them, and the ground is the reason for the roofs.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-REL-2",
   "poolKey": "flagDriven count zero",
   "vid": 3,
   "spine": "Households here are tied to one another by the grazing and the water, and by nothing stranger than that.",
   "faces": [],
   "notebook": []
  },
  {
   "blockId": "DS-GEN-7",
   "poolKey": "structuralSuggestions[]",
   "vid": 3,
   "spine": "What is left undone is the sort of work a standing body would take over, and the place keeps no such body.",
